# Knot requirement 9: theming through host tokens (CSS custom properties),
# with no hard-coded colours. The harness swaps only its tokens; the frames
# must change with them.
log requirement 9: the host themes the view by its tokens alone
settle 2
capture r9_centre_light
act theme-dark
settle 2
capture r9_centre_dark
resize 280 700
settle 3
capture r9_side_dark
